SUMMARY:World Cup Watch Party - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nCome join
  the group for a World Cup Watch Party at 1 p.m. July 4 in Hoboken.\n\n(Th
 e watch party proceeds the Fourth of July Bar Crawl at 3 pm.)\n\nWe'll be 
 tentatively headed to Madd Hatter\, 221 Washington St.\, to watch the Roun
 d of 16 game at 1 p.m. The teams are not yet decided.\n\nThe events comes 
 to you courtesy of suggestions from a few people who reached out about the
  World Cup.\n\nOf course\, join us at any time. Feel free to call or text 
 Andy Milone at 201-234-9609\, or direct message him on Meetup or on Whatsa
 pp\, if you can't find us or have questions.\n\nIt's totally optional to c
 onsume a few adult beverages. Feel free to just come and have a good time 
 hanging out and watching the game.\n\nPlease be smart about travel. The tr
 ain station is not far away and runs late. Parking can be a challenge\, bu
 t there is street parking (where residential permit is not required)\, and
  several paid public parking garages\, including at 112 River St. and 1330
  Willow Ave. Feel free to comment below if interested in carpooling.\n\nQu
 estions? Suggestions? Concerns? You can reach out to Andy Milone at 201-23
 4-9609 (call/text)\, or by message over Meetup or Whatsapp.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315223204/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260612T015534Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T015534Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315110908@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260628T043355Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260704T235900
SUMMARY:Fourth of July Bar Crawl - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nCome join
  the group for a July 4th Bar Crawl at 3 p.m. in Hoboken.\n\nWe'll be star
 ting earlier than usual and in the middle of Washington Street\, rather th
 an up in the northern part of town\, but of course\, join us at any time.\
 n\nWe'll start at Black Bear Hoboken Bar & Grill\, 205 Washington St.\, an
 d then walk around from there.\n\nTentative Schedule:\n\n**3 p.m. -** Blac
 k Bear Bar & Grill\, 205 Washington St.\n\n**5 p.m. -** Tally-Ho\, 215 Was
 hington St.\n\n**6:30 p.m. -** Louise & Jerry's\, 329 Washington St.\n\n**
 7:30 p.m.** \\- Farside Tavern\\\, 531 Washington St\\.\n\n**8:30 p.m.** \
 \- Finnegan's Pub\\\, 734 Willow Ave\\.\n\n**10 p.m. -** 10th & Willow Bar
  & Grill\, 935 Willow Ave.\n\n**12 a.m.** \\- The Ale House\\\, 1034 Willo
 w Ave\\.\n\nWe'll try to post updates in the comments as the day unfolds. 
 Feel free to call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609\, or direct message 
 him on Meetup or on Whatsapp\, if you can't find us or have questions.\n\n
 It's totally optional to consume a few adult beverages. Feel free to just 
 come and have a good time hanging out.\n\nPlease be smart about travel. Th
 e train station is not far away and runs late. Parking can be a challenge\
 , but there is street parking (where residential permit is not required)\,
  and several paid public parking garages\, including at 112 River St. and 
 1330 Willow Ave. Feel free to comment below if interested in carpooling.\n
 \nThis event follows our St. Patrick's Day\, Halloween\, Holiday and other
  bar crawls\, a trend spurred by Ray and Raymond\, two regular attendees o
 f our events.\n\nQuestions? Suggestions? Concerns? You can reach out to An
 dy Milone at 201-234-9609 (call/text)\, or by message over Meetup or Whats
 app.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315110908/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260604T235201Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260604T235201Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
